{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3107040/extras/SteamGif.gif?t=1741372602\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Step into a world of fear with a dark, twisted version of the classic word game 'Hangman' reimagined.\u00a0</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>From the creators of Greg's Deadly Draft</strong> comes a truly terrifying experience...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Trapped in a cold storage room by a madman with murderous intent, you must solve your way out of the situation by correctly guessing words.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Choose a subject that will lead you down a dangerous path. Supply power to the generator while simultaneously dealing with <strong>the Hangbuddy.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The Hangbuddy</strong> was created to do everything in it's power to distract you from the task at hand, make sure to keep an eye out for what shenanigans it might cause...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"\"Colors\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3107040/524b4445f88c803028fe1b9e4f34307099db8cdc.jpg"},{"name":"\"Shapes\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3107040/c3bf554c17b2fa37738056a6ba807476f952e32f.jpg"},{"name":"\"Animals\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3107040/1ebe6faa6283db1870e3db6690f45be2375b6d00.jpg"},{"name":"\"Bugs and Insects\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3107040/2806e9c1dad5aff8563692368a772c90549e4329.jpg"},{"name":"\"Food\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3107040/3e4b9adac37416ca3d4fa56655d6523d6f6502ff.jpg"},{"name":"\"Fruits and Vegetables\"","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3107040/f5103221bd4fedc315f507792